  "tutorialSupply": "Tap the supplier’s box to bring stock to the counter.",
  "tutorialReadOrder": "Each card up top is a customer. It shows which product they want and what level.",
  "tutorialTill": "Your shop keeps selling while you are away. Tap the till to collect — once it is full, it stops filling.",
  "helpTitle": "How to play",
  "helpOpen": "How to play",
  "helpOpenSub": "Go over the rules any time",
  "helpLoopTitle": "The loop",
  "helpLoopBody": "Order stock from the supplier, merge two matching items into a better one, and hand it to the customer who asked for it. Delivering is the only thing that gives experience.",
  "helpMergeTitle": "Merging",
  "helpMergeBody": "Two matching products of the same level become one of the next level. It is worth more than the two apart, so merging always pays. While dragging, the target square turns green if they will merge and red if they will only swap.",
  "helpOrdersTitle": "Orders",
  "helpOrdersBody": "Each card shows the product a customer wants and its level. Orders never expire: delivering in the first few minutes pays more, but after that they simply pay the normal amount. Nothing punishes you for putting the phone down.",
  "helpTillTitle": "The till",
  "helpTillBody": "Your shop keeps selling while you are away and stores it in the till. Tap it to collect. It has a cap: once full it stops filling, so it is worth emptying. You can enlarge it in the shop.",
  "helpShopTitle": "Upgrading the shop",
  "helpShopBody": "Coins upgrade your shop, up to level {max}. Each level earns more per hour, and every few levels the shop gets a new look. The stars in the name show how far you are within the current look.",
  "helpGoalsTitle": "Goals",
  "helpGoalsBody": "Every day brings three new missions: they are what you can do today. Missing them costs nothing — tomorrow brings three more. Achievements, in contrast, last the whole game.",
